      "string_id": "bar_friend_propusk_0",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Hi, sergeant. You remember the deal we had?",
      "JA_current": "よう、軍曹。前に交わした約束を覚えてるか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_friend_propusk",
          "phrase_id": "0",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_friend_propusk_1#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1709,
      "string_id": "bar_friend_propusk_1",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Yeah, I seem to remember something. It was ages ago, though. You were pushing your way to the General on some business or something...",
      "JA_current": "ああ、何となく覚えているな。ずいぶん前の話だが。確か、将軍に用があって会わせてくれと頼み込んできたんだったか……",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_friend_propusk",
          "phrase_id": "1",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_friend_propusk_2#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1712,
      "string_id": "bar_friend_propusk_2",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "So, I got the thing you wanted. Here, take it. Damn, I've sweated blood to get hold of it, man.",
      "JA_current": "あんたが欲しがってたブツを持ってきたぞ。ほら、受け取れ。まったく、手に入れるのに血の小便が出る思いをしたぜ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_friend_propusk",
          "phrase_id": "2",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_friend_propusk_3#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1715,
      "string_id": "bar_friend_propusk_3",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Shit happens. Thanks for the job, but I don't need it any longer. My friend's gone... But I see you are a good guy, so... Don't waste your time here, be welcome!",
      "JA_current": "世の中ままならんもんだな。仕事はありがたいが、もう必要なくなったんだ。その友人は死んじまった……だが、お前はいい奴だな。ここで時間を無駄にするな、中へ入っていいぞ！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_friend_propusk",
          "phrase_id": "3",
